{"suttaId":"tha-ap452","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1034,1075],"vripara":"69"},"segments":{"tha-ap452:0.3":"Bodhigharadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap452:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, dvipadindassa tādino;","tha-ap452:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, bodhigharamakārayiṃ.","tha-ap452:2.1":"“Tusitaṃ upapannomhi, vasāmi ratane ghare;","tha-ap452:2.3":"Na me sītaṃ vā uṇhaṃ vā, vāto gatte na samphuse.","tha-ap452:3.1":"“Pañcasaṭṭhimhito kappe, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap452:3.3":"Kāsikaṃ nāma nagaraṃ, vissakammena [visukammena (syā. ka.)] māpitaṃ.","tha-ap452:4.1":"“Dasayojanaāyāmaṃ, aṭṭhayojanavitthataṃ;","tha-ap452:4.3":"Na tamhi nagare atthi, kaṭṭhaṃ vallī ca mattikā.","tha-ap452:5.1":"“Tiriyaṃ yojanaṃ āsi, addhayojanavitthataṃ;","tha-ap452:5.3":"Maṅgalo nāma pāsādo, vissakammena māpito.","tha-ap452:6.1":"“Cullāsītisahassāni, thambhā soṇṇamayā ahuṃ;","tha-ap452:6.3":"Maṇimayā ca niyyūhā, chadanaṃ rūpiyaṃ ahu.","tha-ap452:7.1":"“Sabbasoṇṇamayaṃ gharaṃ, vissakammena māpitaṃ;","tha-ap452:7.3":"Ajjhāvutthaṃ mayā etaṃ, gharadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap452:8.1":"“Te sabbe anubhotvāna, devamānusake bhave;","tha-ap452:8.3":"Ajjhapattomhi nibbānaṃ, santipadamanuttaraṃ.","tha-ap452:9.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, bodhigharamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap452:9.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, gharadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap452:10.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap452:11.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap452:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap452:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā bodhigharadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap452:14.1":"Bodhigharadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap452:15.1":"Vibhītakavaggo pañcacattālīsamo.","tha-ap452:16.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap452:17.1":"Vibhītakī kolaphalī, billabhallātakappado;","tha-ap452:17.3":"Uttalambaṭakī ceva, āsanī pādapīṭhako.","tha-ap452:18.1":"Vediko bodhighariko, gāthāyo gaṇitāpi ca;","tha-ap452:18.3":"Ekūnāsītikā sabbā, asmiṃ vagge pakittitā."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
